Install Libraries

Arduino IDE → Sketch → Include Library → Manage Libraries.
Install ThingSpeak by MathWorks.
Install DHT sensor library by Adafruit.
Install Adafruit Unified Sensor when prompted.
WiFi is provided with the ESP32 board package.


DHT11 → ESP32
- DHT11 VCC (+) → ESP32 3.3V
- DHT11 GND (−) → ESP32 GND
- DHT11 DATA/OUT → ESP32 GPIO 4
- 10kΩ resistor → between VCC and DATA (if not already built into the module)
Wi-Fi / ThingSpeak
- No additional physical connections required.
- ESP32 uploads temperature and humidity data wirelessly.
ThingSpeak fields:
- Field 1 → Temperature
- Field 2 → Humidity
Note: Replace the Wi-Fi name, password, channel ID and Write API Key with your actual credentials.

